        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "2 months ago",
        "text": "I would like to commend the entire staff of 22 degrees for their wonderful attitude towards, quality of workmanship, customer service and quite frankly of having the attitude of just going above and beyond the norm. A big thanks to them all.",
