        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/105187227759606336266/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVCxkfhNI2_0P5t9xrD2tCkPRShJmALVuJJg3yohFqSk8NIEMMwLg=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "9 months ago",
        "text": "Excellent service! I had 3 wall units installed today and the work that was done is impeccable.  Would recommend without hesitation.  Thank you!",
        "time": 1747336774,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "alexander auer",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/112072488096673598238/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUKZuPAd0Jyw7uL-PmSpAy57uXTiWaLWnJeagSA_WRqh83hTyNa=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "A big thank you to the 22degres team for the great work you did on our new STEFFES ETS system with heat pump. Jason's honesty and support was truely appreciated. He took the time to explain in detail the benefits, what the process involved and the various grant systems available to the public. He was very patient during the process and made sure we were satisfied once it was in place.\n\nAnother big thank you to the installation team. Dave and the crew very professional, courteous and insightful. They made sure any concerns were addressed before completing the job. Great work!",
        "time": 1716728371,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Jonathan Berthold",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/111075745222823437695/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXIPJgbqf6Nw9RDl5wC7oj2wD5uSTCV_qoSGen5ZPYEj-68RTP6dQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "2 years ago",
        "text": "Excellent service! We have been fortunate enough to have the 22degres team clean our unit (inside and outside) twice since we bought our home - both times, their rep was courteous, professional, and informative. Highly recommended!",
        "time": 1697029729,
        "translated": false
